    text: "Delivery scope: authoritative receipt lifecycle composition, shared-worktree drift attribution and idempotent reconciliation, implemented alongside pm-gh1405. TDD owner: real shared Git worktrees and persisted history/receipt bytes; retain malformed/mismatched proof rejection. Full all-status duplicate check is complete at 2901 records; no new umbrella or duplicate item. Only the two actively edited owners are in_progress."
  - created_at: "2026-10-07T05:08:47.421Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "TDD red evidence: real linked Git worktree with durable-only lossless receipt has merge_receipt_attributed_items empty and generic history repair guidance. Regression also asserts committed settlement dominates stale local pending bytes and a second SDK reconciliation leaves history and both receipt copies byte-identical. Immutable provenance validation remains mandatory."
  - created_at: "2026-10-07T05:10:59.902Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Additional TDD red: actual EACCES on durable receipt persistence occurs after the applied merge history audit commits. Retry appended a duplicate empty merge_reconcile event. The shared worktree keeper now requires byte-identical history across retry; the repair planner reuses only identical trusted receipt context, preserving force behavior and ordinary explicit audits."
  - created_at: "2026-10-07T05:28:04.886Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Repository context verification: full live health and history-drift validation pass. Health retains 14 advisory legacy hierarchy findings; validation reports 170 historical resolution-field warnings rather than integrity failures. Complete all-status intake and graph census include terminal history; no fabricated depth or inferred closure evidence is added. GitHub has no open PRs before this delivery, all 23 open issues have PM-file comments, and native security alert inventories plus dependency audit are empty. These observations do not claim the wider open roadmap complete."
  - created_at: "2026-10-07T06:08:02.591Z"
